abstract: >
  Repository for SZL papers and their supporting source. The frozen Doctrine-v11 count baseline
  is c7c0ba17 (749 declarations / 14 axioms / 163 sorries); the separate locked-eight registry
  {F1,F4,F7,F11,F12,F18,F19,F22} is evidenced at proof snapshot
  5cfaf9a3b55fd75e8a2a1197502a93dd8ca68be3. Other CI-green declarations remain experimental.
  Unconditional Lambda uniqueness is disproved as stated; the weaker-condition uniqueness question
  remains open, and conditional Theorem U is axiom-free on its declared hypotheses. The published
  Thesis v8 record is cited below rather than assigned as the software repository's own DOI.
  Supply-chain level is artifact-specific: A11oy and Killinchu carry L1/L2 attestation evidence;
  no organization-wide SLSA level is asserted. Trust is never reported as 100%.
